{"id":"08a0ab6453addb52","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-induction.md","title":"真理归纳公理","display":"df-truth-induction — 真理归纳公理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-induction","aliases":["91-df-truth-induction"],"display":"df-truth-induction — 真理归纳公理","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-truth-theory]]","[[91-df-numeral]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-induction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-induction — 真理归纳公理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-induction-—-真理归纳公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}$\">df-truth-induction — 真理归纳公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (至多以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 为自由变元的公式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_x(a,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(a,n)\\)</span> (以数字 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span> 代入的编码函数)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}^{T}\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{&amp;\n\\bigl(\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},0))\n\\land\n\\forall n\\,[T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))\n\\to T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n+1))]\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\forall n\\,T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))\n\\ \\Bigm|\\\n\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\Bigr\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{I}_{\\mathrm{Truth}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}^{T}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}^{T}\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{&amp;\n\\bigl(\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},0))\n\\land\n\\forall n\\,[T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))\n\\to T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n+1))]\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\forall n\\,T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))\n\\ \\Bigm|\\\n\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\Bigr\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{I}_{\\mathrm{Truth}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}^{T}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}\\)</span> : 真理归纳公理</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{I}_{\\mathrm{Truth}}\">\\(\\mathrm{I}_{\\mathrm{Truth}}\\)</span> : 同一实例集的简写，不是额外推理规则</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：该模式就是把算术归纳应用于含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的公式\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))\">\\(T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))\\)</span>。其结论是\n“每个数字实例都真”，不是\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x)\\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x)\\urcorner)\\)</span>；后者还需量词组合公理。</p>\n<p>真理归纳公理是区分强弱真理理论的关键：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>TB、UTB不含真理归纳（较弱）</li>\n<li>标准 KF 直接包含整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 归纳模式，因而包含这些实例。</li>\n<li>FS 的特征是 capture/release 规则；其有限层刻画不是“逐层添加真理归纳”。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>真理归纳提供了对真理断言作数值归纳的能力。只有再结合足够的组合公理、\n证明编码与公理声性，才能推出“所有 PA 证明的句子都真”这类全局声性\n结论；归纳模式本身不包含该结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-induction-—-真理归纳公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}$","text":"df-truth-induction — 真理归纳公理 $\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-theory","status":"resolved","id":"024b320d234d188f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (真理谓词, see [[91-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_x(a,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline n","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}^{T}\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{&\n\\bigl(\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},0))\n\\land\n\\forall n\\,[T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))\n\\to T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n+1))]\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\to\n\\forall n\\,T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))\n\\ \\Bigm|\\\n\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\Bigr\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{I}_{\\mathrm{Truth}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}^{T}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{I}_{\\mathrm{Truth}}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x)\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false}],"bytes":2218,"backlinks":[{"id":"5fc33cbab29395